05-ADOPTION-MIGRATION-PLAN.md head:
# 05 — Adoption/migration plan

Order follows protocol §9: kernel first, governance authority, spec normalisation, links, product source only where justified, tests/devops, legacy retirement, memory rebuild only after path stability.

Unknown artefacts blocking destructive batches: **0**

## Batches

| # | Description | Entries | Human gate |
|---|---|---|---|
| 0 | Install/pin kernel + establish overlay (no destructive migration) | 0 | false |
| 1 | Governance authority: retire legacy provider rules and governance docs to archive | 2 | false |
| 2 | Spec normalisation: move/extract non-code records into spec/; update citations | 5 | false |
| 3 | Product source relocation (only where justified; human gate) | 0 | false |
| 4 | Tests/devops relocation and import updates | 1 | false |
| 5 | 
